{
  "start": "-PT24H",
  "periodOverride": "inherit",
  "widgets": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 24,
      "height": 3,
      "properties": {
        "markdown": "# MediRoute operations\n\nSydney · Demo environment · **Last 24 hours** by default. Daily trends use UTC. A dash indicates missing observations."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 3,
      "width": 24,
      "height": 3,
      "properties": {
        "markdown": "## Application status\n\nPublic HTTPS checks run when the dashboard opens or refreshes. The history chart shows checks inside the ECS task. **1** healthy · **0** failed · **—** no observation."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "custom",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 6,
      "width": 24,
      "height": 18,
      "properties": {
        "title": "Live HTTPS status",
        "endpoint": "arn:aws:lambda:ap-southeast-2:299952487175:function:customWidgetMediRouteStatus",
        "params": {},
        "updateOn": {
          "refresh": true,
          "resize": false,
          "timeRange": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "metric",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 24,
      "width": 24,
      "height": 6,
      "properties": {
        "title": "Health check history · last 3 hours",
        "region": "ap-southeast-2",
        "metrics": [
          [
            "MediRoute/Demo",
            "AppProbeSuccess",
            "Environment",
            "dev",
            {
              "id": "app",
              "stat": "Minimum",
              "label": "App",
              "color": "#007c78",
              "visible": true
            }
          ],
          [
            "MediRoute/Demo",
            "ApiProbeSuccess",
            "Environment",
            "dev",
            {
              "id": "api",
              "stat": "Minimum",
              "label": "API",
              "color": "#1769e0",
              "visible": true
            }
          ]
        ],
        "period": 60,
        "view": "timeSeries",
        "stacked": false,
        "start": "-PT3H",
        "yAxis": {
          "left": {
            "min": 0,
            "max": 1,
            "showUnits": false
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 30,
      "width": 24,
      "height": 3,
      "properties": {
        "markdown": "## API performance\n\nNumber cards cover the selected range. A query is a recommendation HTTP attempt. **Retried** counts the browser's Try again action. **Failed** counts server-side failures and **Rejected** counts HTTP 4xx. Latency includes measured attempts."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "metric",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 33,
      "width": 4,
      "height": 4,
      "properties": {
        "title": "Queries",
        "region": "ap-southeast-2",
        "metrics": [
          [
            "MediRoute/Demo",
            "Queries",
            "Environment",
            "dev",
            {
              "id": "q",
              "stat": "Sum",
              "label": "Attempts",
              "color": "#1769e0",
              "visible": true
            }
          ]
        ],
        "period": 300,
        "view": "singleValue",
        "stacked": false,
        "setPeriodToTimeRange": true
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "metric",
      "x": 4,
      "y": 33,
      "width": 4,
      "height": 4,
      "properties": {
        "title": "Average latency (ms)",
        "region": "ap-southeast-2",
        "metrics": [
          [
            "MediRoute/Demo",
            "QueryTimeMs",
            "Environment",
            "dev",
            {
              "id": "avg",
              "stat": "Average",
              "label": "Mean",
              "color": "#007c78",
              "visible": true
            }
          ]
        ],
        "period": 300,
        "view": "singleValue",
        "stacked": false,
        "setPeriodToTimeRange": true
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "metric",
      "x": 8,
      "y": 33,
      "width": 4,
      "height": 4,
      "properties": {
        "title": "p95 latency (ms)",
        "region": "ap-southeast-2",
        "metrics": [
          [
            "MediRoute/Demo",
            "QueryTimeMs",
            "Environment",
            "dev",
            {
              "id": "p95",
              "stat": "p95",
              "label": "p95",
              "color": "#7052be",
              "visible": true
            }
          ]
        ],
        "period": 300,
        "view": "singleValue",
        "stacked": false,
        "setPeriodToTimeRange": true
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "metric",
      "x": 12,
      "y": 33,
      "width": 4,
      "height": 4,
      "properties": {
        "title": "Failed",
