    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 43,
      "width": 24,
      "height": 3,
      "properties": {
        "markdown": "## LLM statistics\n\nOne call means one OpenRouter network attempt, including retries and fallbacks. Latency is provider-call wall time. Token totals use reported input and output values. Cost is recorded provider usage and can be partial."
      }
    },
